<title>ISRAEL: Port conditions update - Israel - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Israel - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Labour disputes - Israel</p>
<p>Haifa, Dec 29 - The Histadrot union of workers has begun a series of strikes by various sectors in protest against the government's 1997 budget cuts. The ports have been on strike since Friday, dec 27. Strikes are planned in other sectors as yet undisclosed.</p>
</text>
